  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-AGGR-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "While the other gangs have merely been trading threats, it seems the Fangs are striking back without hesitation.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_SultanaF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SultanaSharzad_MIR_30.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381236,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-AGGR-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Exactly. A group of Fangs Street Snakes are in the River District now. They've cornered the Ferals leader, Achmad Peece, in an alleyway.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_FennecFox_Boss_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Swan_MIR_12.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381232,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-AGGR-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Good work, Swan. You and the Hoods keeping watch in the streets is making all the difference. Keep it up.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_SultanaF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SultanaSharzad_MIR_31.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381236,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-AGGR-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Wizard, this is the perfect opportunity. Go to this alley and drive the Street Snakes away. Then convince Peece to attend our truce talks.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_SultanaF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SultanaSharzad_MIR_32.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381236,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-AGGR-NPC04_Persona",
